('APX-C-2651', '2651', 'NATURE’S CODE', 'NATURE’S CODE — THE VENOM THAT TARGETS CANCER Create a visually compelling, scientifically grounded narrative explaining how honeybee venom (melittin) interacts with cancer cells. Tone must be educational, precise, and cinematic, avoiding exaggeration or cure claims.', 12, null, 'https://x.com/CurieuxExplorer/status/2040473042321838422', 'TITLE: NATURE’S CODE — THE VENOM THAT TARGETS CANCER

FORMAT:
Seedance 2.0 | 15s | 6 cinematic cuts | Hyper-real | Science storytelling

INTENT
Create a visually compelling, scientifically grounded narrative explaining how honeybee venom (melittin) interacts with cancer cells.
