('APX-S-2654-1', 'APX-C-2654', 1, null, null, null, 'Cinematic dark comedy adventure shot on Arri Alexa 35 with handheld jitter, exaggerated reaction shots, and punchy fast-cut editing, featuring moody torch lighting, dusty particle VFX, and a claustrophobic ancient pyramid atmosphere. S1: Low-angle tracking shot as an orange cat explorer in an Indiana Jones-style outfit leads a line of nervous cat apprentices holding flickering torches into a narrow pyramid corridor, shadows dancing wildly on the walls.', null, null, 'S1: shot as an orange cat explorer in an Indiana Jones-style outfit leads a line of nervous cat apprentices holding flickering torches into a narrow pyramid corridor, shadows dancing wildly on the walls.', 'animal-character', null, null, null, null, 'comedic'),
('APX-S-2654-2', 'APX-C-2654', 2, null, null, null, 'S2: Close-up of the orange cat’s confident smirk as he raises a paw dramatically, signaling the team forward, dust drifting in the torchlight. S3: Wide handheld shot revealing a hidden burial chamber filled with ancient coffins and gold relics, the cats’ torchlight barely illuminating the vast darkness. S4: Insert shot of a trembling apprentice cat accidentally brushing against a carved stone pedestal, triggering a subtle “click” echoing ominously.', null, null, 'S2: Close-up of the orange cat’s confident smirk as he raises a paw dramatically, signaling the team forward, dust drifting in the torchlight.', 'animal-character', null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2654-3', 'APX-C-2654', 3, null, null, null, 'S5: Medium shot of a massive Egyptian sarcophagus slowly creaking open, lid sliding aside with a deep grinding sound. S6: Extreme close-up of glowing eyes snapping open inside the coffin—wrapped bandages shifting. S7: Whip pan as a towering mummy gray bear bursts upright from the coffin, bandages unraveling, letting out a deep, absurdly loud roar. S8: Rapid chaotic handheld shots of all cats screaming and scrambling, torches flailing, sparks flying as they run in different directions.', null, null, 'S8: Rapid chaotic shots of all cats screaming and scrambling, torches flailing, sparks flying as they run in different directions.', 'animal-character', 'sliding', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2654-4', 'APX-C-2654', 4, null, null, null, 'S9: Close-up of one apprentice slipping and slamming into a wall lever by accident—CLACK! S10: Wide shot of a massive stone door dropping instantly, sealing the chamber with a thunderous BOOM, cutting off the escaping cats. S11: Silence. Pitch black. Only faint breathing echoes in the darkness. S12: Close-up in darkness as a tiny flame flickers—orange cat nervously lights a small lighter, illuminating his uneasy face.', null, null, 'S12: Close-up in darkness as a tiny flame flickers—orange cat nervously lights a small lighter, illuminating his uneasy face.', 'animal-character', null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2654-5', 'APX-C-2654', 5, null, null, null, 'S13: Slow push-in as the flame reveals the massive mummy gray bear standing inches away, both frozen, staring directly at each other. S14: Extreme close-up split-second beat—wide eyes from both the orange cat and the bear. S15: Sudden explosive reaction—both scream at the exact same time and violently jump backward in perfect sync, knocking over ancient artifacts in a chaotic comedic crash.', null, null, 'S13: Slow as the flame reveals the massive mummy gray bear standing inches away, both frozen, staring directly at each other. S14: Extreme close-up split-second beat—wide eyes from both the orange cat and the bear.', 'animal-character', 'leaping', null, null, null, 'comedic'),
('APX-S-2690-1', 'APX-C-2690', 1, null, null, null, 'High-speed follow + sudden stop. Slow motion during impact (0.3x speed)" Cuts: - Cut: 1 Duration: "1.5 seconds" Action: "Mei (left) and Coco (right) face off 10m apart. Mei half-draws her sword." Camera: "Slow horizontal pan (24mm)" - Cut: 2 Duration: "1.5 seconds" Action: "Mei fully draws her sword. A flash of black-purple aura. Mei moves linearly toward Coco (with afterimages)." Camera: "Ultra-high-speed dolly-in toward Mei (50mm)" - Cut: 3 Duration: "2 seconds" Action: "Coco rotates rapidly around the spear axis.', null, null, 'Mei half-draws her sword." Camera: "Slow horizontal pan ()" - Cut: 2 Duration: "1.5 seconds" "Mei fully draws her sword.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2690-2', 'APX-C-2690', 2, null, null, null, 'Mei''s continuous slashes hit the spear. White-blue sparks. The ribbon spreads out due to centrifugal force." Camera: "Rotation centered on Coco (45mm)" - Cut: 4 Duration: "1.5 seconds" Action: "Mei holds her sword at chest height. Coco holds her spear horizontally. They gauge each other''s movements." Camera: "Anticipation. Horizontal tracking (35mm)" - Cut: 5 Duration: "2 seconds" Action: "Mei performs 7 continuous slashes. Each slash leaves a black light trail. Coco sweeps the ribbon to intercept. The ribbon erases the black trails with white." Camera: "High-speed follow pan toward Mei (50mm)" - Cut: 6 Duration: "1.5 seconds" Action: "Mei delivers a massive diagonal slash.', null, null, 'The ribbon spreads out due to centrifugal force." Camera: "Rotation centered on Coco ()" - Cut: 4 Duration: "1.5 seconds" "Mei holds her sword at chest height. Coco holds her spear horizontally.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2690-3', 'APX-C-2690', 3, null, null, null, 'The black-purple aura crosses half the screen horizontally. Coco looks at the spear diagonally." Camera: "Diagonal tracking of Mei''s trajectory (50mm)" - Cut: 7 Duration: "2 seconds" Action: "Coco rotates her body and changes her spear stance. 3 continuous high-speed thrusts. Mei parries with her sword." Camera: "Flash dolly-in + rotation toward Coco (40mm)" - Cut: 8 Duration: "2.5 seconds" Action: "Sword and spear clash head-on. Sparks explode dramatically (Black-purple x White-blue). Their hair ripples. Dust diffuses radially." Camera: "Fixed.', null, null, 'Coco looks at the spear diagonally." Camera: "Diagonal of Mei''s trajectory ()" - Cut: 7 Duration: "2 seconds" "Coco rotates her body and changes her spear stance.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2690-4', 'APX-C-2690', 4, null, null, null, 'Centered on the point of impact (70mm)" Effect: "Slow motion 0.3x" - Cut: 9 Duration: "1.5 seconds" Action: "Mei and Coco are blown back several meters. They kneel and stare at each other." Camera: "Moving backward simultaneously from both characters (35mm)" - Cut: 10 Duration: "1 second" Action: "Mei swings her sword. Coco rights her spear. Ready for the next starting posture." Camera: "Slow pull-back (24mm)" Loop: "Black and white dust separates and swirls. The battle continues forever." Notes: - "Mei: Linear, sharp movements.', null, null, 'They kneel and stare at each other." Camera: "Moving backward simultaneously from both characters ()" - Cut: 10 Duration: "1 second" "Mei swings her sword.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
